    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;2.08</strong> Diagnostic criteria for encephalocraniocutaneous lipomatosis (based on Moog <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{19574261}</span>)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "check the reference for copyrights (modification in format) 19574261",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 601.95pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"803\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"84\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Site</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Major criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.25pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Minor criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"84\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Skin</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Biopsy-proven NP</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Possible NP in addition to one or more of the other minor skin criteria listed below</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Two or more minor skin criteria listed in the right-hand column</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Possible NP</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Patchy or streaky non-scarring alopecia (without fatty naevus)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Subcutaneous lipoma(s) in the frontotemporal region</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Focal skin aplasia/hypoplasia on the scalp</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Small nodular skin tags on the eyelids or between the outer canthus and tragus</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"84\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Eye</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Choristoma (e.g. epibulbar dermoid)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Corneal and other anterior chamber anomalies</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Ocular or eyelid coloboma</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Calcification of the globe</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"84\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CNS</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Intracranial lipoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Intraspinal lipoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Low-grade glioma (if associated with other suggestive findings)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Two minor CNS criteria</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Abnormal intracranial vessels (e.g. angioma, excessive vessels)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Arachnoid cyst or other abnormality of the meninges</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Complete or partial atrophy of a hemisphere</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Porencephalic cysts(s)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Asymmetrically dilated ventricles or hydrocephalus</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\">Calcification not involving the basal ganglia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"84\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Other</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Jaw tumour (osteoma, odontoma, or ossifying fibroma)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Multiple bone cysts</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; mso-list: none; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Aortic coarctation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.25pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">n/a</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"ParaText\">n/a, not applicable; NP,&nbsp;naevus psiloliparus.</p>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
